// expects: SGL2011
// A malformed `@pin` (DD-12 N4): `y` is missing. The whole pin is dropped
// with SGL2011 ("`@pin` expects `{ x, y }` numbers within ±100 000"). The
// engine check (SGL4021) reads the AST, not the resolved pin, so under an
// engine without pins the same key is also SGL4021: see DOWNSTREAM_EXTRA in
// `packages/render-svg/test/pipeline.test.ts`.
a: { @label: "A", @pin: { x: 10 } }
b: "B"
a -> b
